    "caption": "👀 DeepSeek just gave AI agents eyes\n\nDeepSeek has released DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp, an experimental multimodal model that brings vision to its V4-Flash capabilities.\n\nThe model reportedly matches V4-Flash on text tasks like reasoning, agents, and world knowledge, while making a big jump on multimodal agent benchmarks, pushing performance close to Opus-4.8.\n\nThat means AI agents can now understand images while using tools, opening up workflows that previously required separate vision models.\n\nSource.\n\n@aipost 🏴",
